 "system": "adaptintake_v2",
 "transcript": [
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Hello, I'm here to help you get ready for your appointment. Could you tell me what has been bothering you?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "My sinuses are all congested and draining."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Can you tell me when your sinus congestion and drainage started — whether it came on suddenly or gradually, and if anything seemed to trigger it — and also whether you have any allergies or bad reactions to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Started a few days ago."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Can you tell me in your own words how much the congestion and drainage are affecting your daily life, and what medicines, if any, you take regularly or have taken recently—including any new or changed ones, and the amounts if you know them?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I still walk a mile or two most days."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Could you tell me a bit about your health in the past — any long-term conditions, past illnesses, operations, or hospital stays you’ve had?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I was diagnosed with diabetes last fall."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Do you have any allergies or bad reactions to medicines, or are you not sure?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No, I haven't noticed anything like that."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "How much are the congestion and drainage bothering you day to day — a little, a fair amount, or a lot?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "A fair amount, but I feel well overall."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "What medicines do you take regularly, and have you started or changed any recently — and if you know, what dose?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "My daughter keeps track of my medicines for me."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Since the congestion and drainage started, have you noticed any changes in things like your appetite, sleep, weight, or energy?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Energy's fine, I feel well overall."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Have you noticed whether lying down or sitting up changes the congestion or drainage?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I haven't really noticed that."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Is the congestion and drainage there all the time, or does it come and go?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "It's been there the last several days."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Besides your diabetes, are there any other health conditions you see a doctor or nurse about regularly?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Just my gynecologist, I see her regularly."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "What’s on your mind most about what’s been going on, or what are you hoping we can help with at your visit?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Just hoping to get this congestion cleared up."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Since the congestion started, have you noticed any changes in your bladder or bowel habits, or in your breathing?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No changes in my bowels."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Can you tell me what the congestion feels like for you?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Just stuffy and draining, nothing more than that."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Besides the stuffiness and drainage, is there anything else you’ve noticed since this started that you think I should know about?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No, my son checks in on me too, he worries."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, that is very helpful. I have put together a short summary of what you told me. Please read it and tell me if anything should be corrected before it goes to your doctor."
  }
 ],
